{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triangle: Cursed Town is a 1\u20134 player online co-op exorcism horror set in a sealed, abandoned village. After a string of disappearances, <strong>you and your team are sent by the Church</strong> to investigate what was buried under the village\u2019s silence. The roads are closed, the locals are gone, and the only thing left is the curse\u2026 and whatever still feeds on it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the haunted location you chose and gather evidence with your team. The village doesn\u2019t give answers for free and every minute you spend inside raises the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/b4b0cbfa63060f8b4d1783e76c8668ec.poster.avif?t=1767405234\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/b4b0cbfa63060f8b4d1783e76c8668ec.webm?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IDENTIFY THE ENTITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to determine what you\u2019re dealing with. <strong>Face 20 entity types</strong>, each pushing you into different risks and reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/07924da16eba47dcdf1981fb0e470fd5.poster.avif?t=1767405234\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/07924da16eba47dcdf1981fb0e470fd5.webm?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/07924da16eba47dcdf1981fb0e470fd5.mp4?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE THE RITUAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the required ritual items, set up the ritual space, and follow the steps under pressure. The longer you stay, the more the village pushes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/f831942737d1f5cc10fe060e0be6abb7.poster.avif?t=1767405234\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/f831942737d1f5cc10fe060e0be6abb7.webm?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP HORROR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication and timing matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes have consequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/d2c93c5e000f7e6e3d369069762cd31e.poster.avif?t=1767405234\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/d2c93c5e000f7e6e3d369069762cd31e.webm?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266950?t=1767405234","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266950?t=1767405234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/38b52d3d3bad3ff6a3d962c60657c7e0d13e87b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767405234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka