></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IDENTIFY THE ENTITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to determine what you\u2019re dealing with. <strong>Face 20 entity types</strong>, each pushing you into different risks and reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/07924da16eba47dcdf1981fb0e470fd5.poster.avif?t=1767405234\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/07924da16eba47dcdf1981fb0e470fd5.webm?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/07924da16eba47dcdf1981fb0e470fd5.mp4?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE THE RITUAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the required ritual items, set up the ritual space, and follow the steps under pressure. The longer you stay, the more the village pushes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/f831942737d1f5cc10fe060e0be6abb7.poster.avif?t=1767405234\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/f831942737d1f5cc10fe060e0be6abb7.webm?t=1767405234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP HORROR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication and timing matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes have consequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop 